      "keywords": ["Lab3目标", "物理内存管理", "物理页", "页帧分配器", "三个任务"],
      "title": "Lab3 的地址计算与页帧分配目标",
      "content": "Lab3 在稳定 trap 基线之上引入 4 KiB 物理页。学习顺序是先区分字节地址与页号并完成对齐计算，再用半开区间实现顺序分配，最后加入释放、复用和错误检查。地址计算是分配器边界安全的前提；分配器既要能返回空闲页，也必须避免把内核镜像和启动数据当作可分配内存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab3-address-types",
      "lab": "lab3",
      "stage": 1,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "address",
      "concepts": ["PhysAddr", "PhysPageNum", "byte address", "page number", "PAGE_SIZE"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/memory/address.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["address-page-confusion", "wrong-unit", "stage1-failure"],
      "hintLevel": 1,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab3/README.md; docs/labs/lab3/TASKS.md; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/src/memory/address.rs",
      "keywords": ["PhysAddr是什么", "PhysPageNum是什么", "地址和页号", "PAGE_SIZE", "4KiB页"],
      "title": "物理地址与物理页号不是同一种单位",
      "content": "PhysAddr 以字节为单位描述具体位置，PhysPageNum 描述第几张物理页。页号转换为地址后应落在该页起点，地址转换为页号时还要决定向下包含当前地址还是向上跨过未完整覆盖的页。4 KiB 是 2 的幂，因此页内偏移对应低 12 位，但实现和解释都应继续使用 PAGE_SIZE 表达统一约束。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab3-rounding-alignment",
      "lab": "lab3",
      "stage": 1,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "alignment",
      "concepts": ["floor", "ceil", "page_offset", "start_address", "alignment", "4096"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/memory/address.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["off-by-one", "aligned-ceil-error", "wrong-offset"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab3/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab3/HINTS.md; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/src/memory/address.rs",
      "keywords": ["floor和ceil", "对齐地址ceil", "page_offset", "页起始地址", "off-by-one"],
      "title": "floor、ceil、页内偏移与页起始地址",
      "content": "floor 返回包含当前地址的页号，ceil 返回页起点不小于当前地址的第一张页。地址已对齐时二者相同，未对齐时 ceil 才进入下一页。page_offset 始终落在一页之内，页号的 start_address 则回到偏移为零的页起点。诊断时应分别使用一个整页地址和一个整页加小偏移的地址验证边界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab3-half-open-range",
      "lab": "lab3",
      "stage": 2,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "allocator",
      "concepts": ["half-open range", "start", "end", "next", "exhaustion"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/memory/frame_allocator.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["end-frame-allocated", "range-error", "allocator-exhausted"],
      "hintLevel": 1,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab3/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab3/HINTS.md; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/src/memory/frame_allocator.rs",
      "keywords": ["半开区间", "start end", "end不包含", "分配耗尽", "越界页号"],
      "title": "分配器为什么使用半开区间",
      "content": "管理范围采用 [start, end)，意味着 start 可以分配而 end 只是上界。这样能用 next 是否仍小于 end 判断顺序区是否还有页，也方便把两个相邻范围首尾连接。若把 end 当作最后一张可分配页，会越过既定内存边界；耗尽后应返回无页可用，而不是继续生成页号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab3-safe-physical-bounds",
      "lab": "lab3",
      "stage": 2,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "memory-layout",
      "concepts": ["ekernel", "kernel_end", "PHYS_MEMORY_END", "device tree", "kernel image"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/memory/mod.rs", "kernel/linker.ld"],
      "symptoms": ["kernel-overwrite", "boot-data-overwrite", "qemu-timeout", "unsafe-range"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab3/TASKS.md; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/src/memory/mod.rs; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/linker.ld",
      "keywords": ["ekernel", "kernel_end", "物理内存上界", "避免覆盖内核", "设备树"],
      "title": "可分配区间必须避开内核与启动数据",
      "content": "starter 通过链接符号 ekernel 得到内核镜像之后的地址，并用保守的 PHYS_MEMORY_END 避开启动阶段提供的数据。可分配起点应从 kernel_end 向上对齐，终点应由物理上界向下取整。只有位于该半开区间的页才可进入分配器；看到超时并不能直接证明发生了覆盖，还需要分配页号或运行事件等额外证据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab3-allocator-state",
