      "stage": 2,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "allocator",
      "concepts": ["StackFrameAllocator", "init", "alloc", "next", "initialized", "None"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/memory/frame_allocator.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["uninitialized-allocation", "same-frame-returned", "exhaustion-failure"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab3/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab3/HINTS.md; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/src/memory/frame_allocator.rs",
      "keywords": ["分配器初始化", "alloc返回同一页", "next推进", "未初始化分配", "返回None"],
      "title": "顺序页帧分配器的最小状态机",
      "content": "初始化需要记录有效边界并把下一候选页放在 start。每次从顺序区成功分配一页后，next 都必须向前推进；未初始化、区间无效或顺序区和回收区都为空时不能返回页。状态查询只描述分配器内部记录，不能替代对实际返回页唯一性、边界和耗尽行为的验证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab3-option-result",
      "lab": "lab3",
      "stage": 2,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "rust-api",
      "concepts": ["Option", "Result", "allocation failure", "deallocation error"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/memory/frame_allocator.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["api-confusion", "error-handling", "invented-error-variant"],
      "hintLevel": 1,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab3/TASKS.md; origin/lab3-starter:kernel/src/memory/frame_allocator.rs",
      "keywords": ["alloc为什么返回Option", "dealloc为什么返回Result", "错误类型", "FrameAllocatorError"],
      "title": "alloc 使用 Option、dealloc 使用 Result 的原因",
      "content": "alloc 的失败主要表示当前没有可分配页，因此 Option 足以表达有或无；dealloc 的失败可能来自未初始化、越界、未曾分配或重复释放，需要 Result 保留错误原因。具体可用的错误变体必须以当前分支的 FrameAllocatorError 为准，课程知识不能声称一个尚未从代码中观察到的变体已经存在。"
    },
